> I am curious about the status of the @slot tag in roxygen.

@slot never made it in, Bastian, because Rd has no direct
@slot-equivalent; one alternative is to use something like the
following in the description:

  \describe{
    \item{<slot-1>}{<slot-1-description>}
    \item{<slot-2>}{<slot-2-description>}
    ...
    \item{<slot-n>}{<slot-n-description>}
  }

If it would be useful, we could probably append such a table directly
to the description based on @slot-parameters.

Best, Peter

